# DL / Vision Dataset Contract Review

1. Find dataset classes, backend selectors, and split logic.
2. Record required files, directories, metadata, and annotation schemas.
3. Record transforms, normalization, and sampling assumptions.
4. Compare code assumptions with actual directory layout.
5. Produce a preflight validation checklist.
